;
RESIDENT CALLER COMMANDS
These are built into the installed resident packages.

A - H - List resident commands
B - CLS - Clear the terminal display
C - ECHO - Display command-line text
D - NOTE - Command-sequence comment
E - R - Resident disk reset
F - SP - Display free disk space
G - IF - Start a conditional command level
H - ELSE - Select the other if branch
I - FI - End one if level
J - XIF - End all ifs when current state is true
K - AND - Add a test to the current if level
L - OR - Alternative test at the current if level
M - IFQ - Display conditional state
N - ZIF - Clear all conditional levels
:A:HELP:H.HLP
:B:HELP:CLS.HLP
:C:HELP:ECHO.HLP
